{"id":"235a1528abe157b8","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-substitution-lemma.md","title":"Substitution Lemma","display":"df-substitution-lemma — Substitution Lemma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-substitution-lemma","aliases":["90-df-substitution-lemma"],"display":"df-substitution-lemma — Substitution Lemma","depends_on":["[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-representability-theorem]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-strong-representation]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-substitution-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-substitution-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-lemma — Substitution Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>、指定变量和实际 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 为互异指定变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a> 的数值图定义；函数的输入元组与输出在该关系中按顺序平铺。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T]\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\quad\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(\\mathrm{Sub}_S),\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T]\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\quad\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(\\mathrm{Sub}_S),\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>原始递归函数全递归，对其图应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a>，再合取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x\\land y=y\\land z=z\">\\(x=x\\land y=y\\land z=z\\)</span> 使三个指定自由变量都出现。自反等式不改变逐数正负实例的可证性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来的图关系表示结论。它不宣称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 统一证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x,y\\exists!z\\,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\">\\(\\forall x,y\\exists!z\\,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\)</span>；后者是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a> 的额外要求。例子必须写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S(g(P(v)),0)=g(P[\\overline0/v])\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S(g(P(v)),0)=g(P[\\overline0/v])\\)</span>，不能用已表示截断减法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{sub}\\)</span> 代替代入函数，也不能把二元对角限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}\\)</span> 与本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 混成同一元数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representability-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"31a1cb59fb59977d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representability-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-strong-representation","status":"resolved","id":"cc78339b84b14c7b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-strong-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-8","tar